SAEs have drawbacks, however.
SAEs can struggle to capture logical hierarchical
structure ( Costa et al., 2026 ) ;
they do not efficiently capture structures of multi-dimensional features ( Engels et al., 2025 ) ;
they do not generally capture relations across multiple tokens ( Lubana et al., 2026 ) ;
and the structure of Relational Composition ( Wattenberg and Viégas, 2024 ) remains difficult for SAEs.

blocks.zh:
